+
+## Unavailable optional CPU timing (M02, 2026-11-09)
+
+[gta-recomp] Host-spike diagnostics preserve the -1 unavailable-clock sentinel
+when calculating deltas, and check clock_gettime failure. Subtracting two
+sentinels previously printed zero CPU time on hosts without a thread CPU clock.
+No elapsed-time substitute or performance claim is introduced; supported clocks
+retain their existing subtraction. This affects diagnostics, not guest timing.
